{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2024-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1715126400, "end_date": 1715817599, "month_true_total": 604, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:55:03 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "165433529", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091359540", "personaname": "lonelyPorter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lonelyPorter/", "num_games_owned": 445, "num_reviews": 280, "playtime_forever": 9005, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4365, "last_played": 1733944286, "avatar": "2c25b79be402251e891be9eef21b8cd9f0689fa5"}, "language": "english", "review": "My first soulslike, its similar to darksouls in the fact, that everything can kill you very fast, but other than darksouls, you have guns here, and different archetype skills, a bit like in Borderlands, with elemental builds, melee builds, minion builds etc.\r\nAfter I learned to git gud, I had lots of fun with the bosses and the different builds and stuff to explore.\r\n\r\nCan be played in coop with up to 3 players, which I did.\r\n\r\nHas lots of content, you can play each world multiple times and still have stuff you didn't see.\r\n\r\nThe story exists, its not bad, but I wonder, why the lines I pick aren't voiced, when everything else is.", "timestamp_created": 1715809840, "timestamp_updated": 1715809840, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "165420533", "author": {"steamid": "76561198222994708", "personaname": "Goth Ihop", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198222994708/", "num_games_owned": 241, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 4085, "